<title>FRANCE: Goldman upgrades Societe Generale.</title>
<headline>Goldman upgrades Societe Generale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs confirmed on Monday market talk that it upgraded Societe Generale bank to market outperformer from market performer and revised upward its earnings forecasts.</p>
<p>Societe Generale stock was up 3.25 percent at 667 francs on volume of 133,530 shares at 1136 GMT. The market was up 0.42 percent.</p>
<p>Goldman Sachs has marked up earnings per share to 58.40 francs from 50.30 for 1996 , to 62.90 from 52.50 for 1997, and to 69.40 from 56.30 for 1998.</p>
